@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title Resume password change and grant invalidation
actor Owner
participant "User ResumeController" as Controller
database "Resume record" as Record
actor Visitor
participant "Public access check" as Access
participant "Visitor session" as Session
Owner -> Controller : Submit password and confirmation
Controller -> Controller : Check ownership and validate minimum length/confirmation
Controller -> Record : Store Hash::make(new password)
Controller --> Owner : Redirect with success
Visitor -> Access : Next protected public request
Access -> Record : Read current password hash
Access -> Access : Derive HMAC token with application key
Access -> Session : Read public_resume_access_{resume ID}
alt Stored grant differs from current token
 Access --> Visitor : Access rejected; view prompts password
 Visitor -> Access : Submit current password through throttled route
 Access -> Record : Verify password hash
 Access -> Session : Store current token after successful verification
 Access --> Visitor : Redirect to resume view
else Grant matches current token
 Access --> Visitor : Permit request subject to active status and route rules
end
@enduml
